fsmtrie
------------------------------------------
This is the Fast String Matcher Trie project. This C-based library provides a
simple API for the storage and fast matching of ASCII, Extended ASCII, and
32-bit wide token strings.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libfsmtrie-devel-2.0.0-1bl2
  libfsmtrie3-2.0.0-1bl2
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20261107-1
  binutils-2.47-1
  check-0.15.2-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/farsightsec/fsmtrie

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/farsightsec/fsmtrie/archive/refs/tags/v2.0.0.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack fsmtrie-2.0.0-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./fsmtrie-2.0.0-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/fsmtrie-2.0.0-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/fsmtrie-2.0.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libfsmtrie3-2.0.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libfsmtrie-devel-2.0.0-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(fsmtrie)
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/fsmtrie.README
  /usr/share/doc/fsmtrie/COPYRIGHT
  /usr/share/doc/fsmtrie/LICENSE
  /usr/share/doc/fsmtrie/README.md

(libfsmtrie3)
  /usr/bin/cygfsmtrie-3.dll

(libfsmtrie-devel)
  /usr/include/fsmtrie/fsmtrie.h
  /usr/include/fsmtrie/version.h
  /usr/lib/libfsmtrie.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/libfsmtrie.pc

